<title>POLAND: CHEMISKOR SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.05 MLN.</title>
<headline>CHEMISKOR SEPT NET RISES TO PLN 0.05 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER		1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.05 vs   0.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.10 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.12 vs   0.09</p>
<p> Sales		    1.75 vs   1.62</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.38 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.67 vs   0.42</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.52 vs   0.66</p>
<p> Sales		    9.57 vs   8.89</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish leather company is Chemiskor SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
